
# Arduino Libraries

This directory contains the shared Arduino libraries used by packages in this
repository.

| Library | Description | Include |
|---|---|---|
| **at_client** | atSDK for ESP32 — atclient, atchops, atauth, atlogger, cJSON | `#include <atsdk.h>` |
| **NoPorts** | NoPorts daemon (sshnpd) — secure tunneling via atProtocol | `#include <NoPorts.h>` |

## Usage

### Arduino IDE

Copy the desired library folder(s) to your Arduino libraries directory:

    cp -r lib/at_client ~/Documents/Arduino/libraries/
    cp -r lib/NoPorts   ~/Documents/Arduino/libraries/

### PlatformIO

Reference the libraries from your project's `platformio.ini`:

    [env:esp32dev]
    platform = espressif32
    board = esp32dev
    framework = arduino
    lib_extra_dirs = ../../lib
    lib_deps = NoPorts

NoPorts depends on at_client, so PlatformIO will pull in both automatically.

See `packages/NoPorts/` for a complete reference project.
